DIGITAL NOTES MANAGEMENT SYSTEM
A Python Project

Name: Samir Kumar Mahato
ERP: 00318

1. INTRODUCTION
Digital Notes Management System ek simple Python program hai. Isme user apne notes ko save, dekh, search, edit aur delete kar sakta hai. Saare notes http://notes.txt file me save hote hai, taaki program band karne ke baad bhi data rahe.

2. OBJECTIVE
1. Notes ko digital tarike se manage karna
2. Notes ko file me permanently save karna
3. User ko easy menu dena

3. REQUIREMENTS
Language: Python
Software: VS Code
File: http://notes.txt for data storage

4. FEATURES
1. Add Note - Naya note add karna
2. View All Notes - Saare notes dekhna
3. Search Note - Kisi word se note dhundhna
4. Edit Note - Purane note ko badalna
5. Delete Note - Note ko hatana
6. Exit - Program band karna

5. HOW IT WORKS
User menu se option choose karta hai. Agar Add Note choose karega to note http://notes.txt me save ho jayega. Search karne par program file me se us word wala note dhundh kar dikhata hai.

6. CONCLUSION
Is project se mujhe Python me file handling, loop, if-else aur menu-driven program banana seekhne ko mila. Ye system daily notes manage karne ke liye useful hai.

